{"about_the_game":"Prove yourself the best spell caster in the world; use your magic circles and win the Mana Go Round Tournament!<br><br>Flip and drop mana into matching circles.<br>(Even amateur casters can do it!)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677920/extras/ce236f5c2304889ccfc689cd0df2c647.poster.avif?t=1750748004\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677920/extras/ce236f5c2304889ccfc689cd0df2c647.webm?t=1750748004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677920/extras/ce236f5c2304889ccfc689cd0df2c647.mp4?t=1750748004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Rotate magic circles when nothing's falling into place.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677920/extras/a7445d93add0a77e14061415c645a886.poster.avif?t=1750748004\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677920/extras/a7445d93add0a77e14061415c645a886.webm?t=1750748004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677920/extras/a7445d93add0a77e14061415c645a886.mp4?t=1750748004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Go for big, or even HUGE, magic circles like a pro!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677920/extras/23d9785ef815e08a8966f51683fa45ec.poster.avif?t=1750748004\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677920/extras/23d9785ef815e08a8966f51683fa45ec.webm?t=1750748004\" type=\"